        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**OPEN VIEWING THURSDAY 24th SEPTEMBER 12:00 - 12:30**\r\n\r\nOne-Bedroom Apartment For Sale\r\n\r\nBell Properties are delighted to present Apartment 84 Spencer House to the market. This attractive one-bedroom apartment is ideally positioned within Custom House Square, a well-established and highly regarded development in the heart of Dublin’s International Financial Services Centre (IFSC).\r\n\r\nThe property offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation, making it an excellent opportunity for a first-time buyer, investor or purchaser seeking a convenient Dublin city base.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a spacious open-plan living and dining area, a fitted kitchen, a generous double bedroom and a bathroom. The apartment benefits from excellent natural light and well-planned living space, with the layout providing a comfortable and practical home.\r\n\r\nCustom House Square is a secure, gated development with beautifully maintained communal areas and landscaped grounds. The location is particularly appealing, with the IFSC, Docklands and Dublin city centre all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nThe apartment is exceptionally well positioned for access to Dublin’s major financial and business districts, while an excellent choice of cafés, restaurants, bars, shops and leisure facilities are close by. The area is also exceptionally well served by public transport, including the LUAS, DART and Dublin Bus, with Connolly Station and the city centre within walking distance.\r\n\r\nFor an investor, the property represents an attractive opportunity in an established rental location, while owner-occupiers will appreciate the combination of city living, convenience and accessibility.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nOne-bedroom apartment\r\nBright and well-proportioned accommodation\r\nSecure gated development\r\nLandscaped communal grounds\r\nExcellent city-centre location\r\nSituated in the heart of the IFSC\r\nWalking distance to the Docklands and Dublin city centre\r\nExcellent public transport connections\r\nIdeal first-time purchase or investment opportunity\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
